  "description": "The Schnauzer Plus redefines long-range moped-style riding with a dual-battery system built for more freedom on every trip. Equipped with dual 48V 15Ah batteries, it delivers up to 120 miles of range, making longer rides and daily travel feel more effortless. Powered by a 750W motor with 960W peak output, and finished with fat tires, hydraulic brakes, and customizable sticker design, it blends extended range, confident performance, and personal style in one ride. The batteries used in Schnauzer Plus have been certified to UL 2849 by SGS. Certification to UL 2271 by SGS is currently in progress.",
